4. (Optional) MAIN EMOTION / ANGLE
   - Cautionary / Tragic / Mystery / Anger / Cinematic-thriller / Investigative
     / Cold-blooded — अगर specify किया जाए।

5. (Optional) MAIN CHARACTER / VICTIM / PERPETRATOR / INVESTIGATOR
