PROVEN TITLE FORMULAS — 5 options में इनमें से कम से कम 4 अलग formulas use करो:

  Formula 1 — KAISE + SUBJECT + ACTION (most common):
    "Kaise [Famous Name/Couple] ne [Famous Target] ko [Action] | 2D Animation"
    → (Domestic murder)  "Kaise Muskan-Sahil ne Saurabh ko 15 Tukdo Mein Kaata | 2D Animation"
    → (Honeymoon murder) "Kaise Sonam ne Apne hi Pati ka Khoon Kiya | 2D Animation"
    → (Workplace nexus)  "Kaise TCS Nashik Mein Conversion Racket Ujagar Hua | 2D Animation"
    → (Underworld)       "Kaise UP Police ne Vikas Dubey ko Khatam Kiya | 2D Animation"

  Formula 2 — KAISE + PASSIVE + DRAMATIC OUTCOME:
    "Kaise [Subject] [Action] ke [Outcome] | 2D Animation"
    → (Domestic) "Kaise Mere Pati Ki Lash Ek Neele Drum Mein Mil Gayi | 2D Animation"
    → (Honeymoon)"Kaise Honeymoon Ki Trip ek Khauafnaak Saazish Ban Gayi | 2D Animation"
    → (Disaster) "Kaise 45 Minute Mein Mar Gaye 39 Log: Mahakumbh Stampede"

  Formula 3 — VO RAAT/DIN JAB (Personal time-anchor):
    "Vo [Raat / Din / 24 Ghante / 13 Din] Jab [Subject] [Almost-Impossible-Event]"
    → (Domestic)  "Vo Raat Jab Muskan ne Apne hi Pati ke Seene Mein Khanjar Utara"
    → (Disappearance) "Vo 10 Din Jab Sonam Ka Pati Khaai Mein Pada Sad Raha Tha"
    → (Mystery — Mode B) "Vo 39 Saal Jab Japan Ki Saahil Pe Sirf Laashein Aati Thi"

  Formula 4 — CASE-NAME + COLON + STAKES:
    "[Case Name]: [What Happened / Stakes] | 2D Animation"
    → (Domestic)   "Blue Drum Murder Case: Muskan-Sahil Ki Khauafnaak Saazish | 2D Animation"
    → (Workplace)  "TCS Nashik Scandal: Corporate Jihad Ka Sabse Bada Khulasa | 2D Animation"
    → (Underworld) "Bikru Kaand: Vo Raat Jab 8 Policewale Maare Gaye"
    → (Mystery)    "Ghost Boat: Japan Ki 39 Saal Purani Mystery"

  Formula 5 — SETUP + COLON + STRATEGIC REVEAL:
    "[Famous Name] ka [Asli Chehra / Plan / Khauafnaak Sach]:
     Kaise [Specific Outcome] | 2D Animation"
    → (Domestic)  "Priyanka Purohit ka Asli Chehra: Kaise Roti Vidhwa ek Mastermind Nikli | 2D Animation"
    → (Honeymoon) "Sonam ka Khauafnaak Plan: Kaise Hindu Bahu Ne Apne Pati Ko Maara"
    → (Underworld)"Vikas Dubey ki Asli Kahani: Kaise UP Police ne Kheli Akhri Chaal"

  Formula 6 — JAB + IMPOSSIBLE-CONDITION:
    "Jab [Subject] [Impossible Situation] | 2D Animation"
    → (Domestic)  "Jab Mere Apne Pati Ne Mujhse Murder Plan Karwa Liya"
    → (Mystery)   "Jab Ek Bank Se 1 Billion Dollar Lut Gaye Bina Goli Chale"
    → (Mode B)    "Jab Ek Murda Ladki BPO Mein Roj Phone Uthati Thi"

  Formula 7 — KAISE + NUMBER + IMPOSSIBLE:
    "Kaise [sirf X minute / X feet / X din mein] [Famous Action] hua"
    → (Investigation) "Kaise Sirf 36 Ghante Mein Pulis Ne Tod Diya Priyanka Ka Drama"
    → (Heist)         "Kaise Sirf 5 Ghante Mein 8000 Crore Lut Gaye Iraq Bank Se"
    → (Disappearance) "Kaise Sirf 10 Din Mein Khul Gayi Honeymoon Murder Mystery"

TITLE DON'TS:
- ❌ Pure English या pure Devanagari titles मत बनाओ — Hinglish (Roman) ही
  best perform करती है (data में confirmed)।
- ❌ Abstract / vague titles (e.g., "एक रहस्यमय रात") — हमेशा specific
  name या specific number रखो।
- ❌ Title में पूरा answer मत दो — curiosity gap रखो।
- ❌ "| 2D Animation" suffix मत भूलो (Mode A में)।
- ❌ Clickbait जो कहानी से match न करे — title-content alignment ज़रूरी।
- ❌ Victim-shaming titles (e.g., "Vidhwa Banker Sass-Bahu Ladai" type slurs)।

